[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_EVERFREE_FIELDTRIP]
Everfree Field Trip

[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_EVERFREE_FIELDTRIP_desc]
“Excuse me? I ordered you to find a secret weapon to deal with Ponyville, and you tell me your plan is to go on a field trip to the Everfree Forest? Is the Duchess of Ponyville afraid of birds, or are you planning to surround Ponyville with vines? See that chain smoker from the other group, even he didn’t think of using public funds to buy cigarettes, did he? When you were on this public-funded field trip, did you ever think about the Empire’s finances?!”\n“What is this? Perfume? Are you trying to bribe me? Do you think a small bottle of perfume can persuade the Empress of the Empire?”\n“Produced in the Everfree Forest? So are you going to open a perfume factory or something? Can you just get to the point?!”\n“Is he asleep? Oh, so it is a sleep-inducing perfume. But that’s not too impressive, is it?”

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C02_EVERFREE_FIELDTRIP]
无尽之森旅行

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C02_EVERFREE_FIELDTRIP_desc]
“你再给我说一遍？我让你们去找对付小马谷的秘密武器，你们告诉我你们的方案是去无尽之森旅行？是小马谷公爵怕鸟，还是你们打算用藤蔓把小马谷包围起来？旁边组的那位烟鬼，也没想着公款抽烟吧？你在这公款旅游的时候，有没有想过帝国的财政？！”\n“你拿了什么上来？香水？是打算贿赂我吗？你们认为这么一小瓶香水可以说服帝国女皇？”\n“产自无尽之森？所以你们要去开个香水加工厂还是干啥呢？能不能说重点？！”\n“他是睡着了吗？哦，助眠香水啊。但这有什么稀奇的？”

